cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mixedFlowR in scientific work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mixedFlowR: Design-Aware Mixed Models for Agronomic Experiments"
version: 0.1.0.9000
abstract: >
  A design-aware orchestration layer for classical and modern mixed-model analyses in
  agronomy and related experimental sciences. The package connects legacy split-plot error
  strata with linear and generalized linear mixed models, residual covariance structures,
  robust estimation, bootstrap inference, generalized additive models for location scale
  and shape, Bayesian multilevel models, nonlinear mixed models, spatial field-trial
  analysis, multi-environment trials, diagnostics, publication-ready figures and tables,
  and guided teaching workflows.
authors:
